                <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="&lt;html&gt;Low-carb diets have been popular for decades &#x2014; especially for weight loss.The primary aim of the diet is to force your body to use more fats for fuel instead of using carbs as a main source of energy.&lt;/html&gt;"/>
